    "cLszVcNXxEw": {
      "result": "verified_selected_lines",
      "notes": "Three branches from seven pieces after Kxg3 at 148s. Source final queen offers Qg1/Kf3/Qf1/Ke3/Qc1 force Rxc1 Kxb2, then Rc2+ Kb1 Rc4; b8=Q is explicitly completed independently. Immediate Rxg1 comparison wins. A different king retreat Kf4 makes immediate Qf1+ a drawing mistake, with Ke5 the checked drawing reply; Ke3 and rook capture do not preserve that draw. Earlier ten/eight-piece play remains context.",
